# M18: Ctrl+Page Up and Ctrl+Page Down scroll the text screen three lines without moving the caret, on a document of sixty lines. Two down, one up,
# then End: the caret was on the first line all along, so End shows it again.
@copy scroll.rtf
@open SCROLL.RTF
ctrlpagedown
ctrlpagedown
ctrlpageup
ctrlpagedown ctrlpagedown ctrlpagedown ctrlpagedown
end
